## Database safety requirements

- Store appointment instants in UTC-compatible timestamp fields.
- Use IANA time zones for staff schedules.
- Validate all appointment time ranges.
- Prevent overlapping active appointments for the same staff member.
- Implement a PostgreSQL GiST exclusion constraint using `tstzrange` and `btree_gist`.
- Use half-open time intervals `[)`.
- Allow adjacent bookings.
- Keep cancelled appointment history.
- Use transactional database writes.
- Preserve referential integrity.
- Do not rely solely on frontend validation.

Support migrations and seed scripts.

